{
  "id": "153",
  "document": "静躁独行.txt",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "153:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '153'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36044:36060"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36060:36062"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你把双臂抱在胸前，也盯着他。你不愿让这家伙看到你示弱。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36062:36091"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "突然，他朝你跑来。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36091:36102"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "他跑得拼了命，眼睛一眨不眨，双掌随着脚步摆动着划破空气。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36102:36132"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "他朝着你直冲而来。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36132:36143"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你蹒跚着往旁边躲了一步，尝试逃离。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36143:36162"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次困难难度的敏捷检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36162:36178"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 148。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36178:36194"
    },
    {
      "id": "153:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 149。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:36194:36210"
    }
  ]
}
